1
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:02,920
I wasn't imagining it.

2
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:06,000
I saw two ghosts standing right next to you,

3
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,480
telling you to jump.

4
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:11,240
Can I stay here for a while?

5
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:13,400
I know what you're up to.

6
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:16,367
Do I have to catch you red-handed
before you admit it?

7
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:17,840
I'm really just working there.

8
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,880
I've been working myself to the bone lately.

9
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:22,400
You must know why.

10
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:24,840
Nat belongs to me alone.

11
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:29,600
If we're going to settle this,
I'll see for myself if you two...

12
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:06,080
You were with her all night?

13
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,400
My work isn't finished yet.

14
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,400
From what I heard, it was.

15
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,880
You expect me to never start another project?

16
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,680
I'm busy, Yo.

17
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:25,880
Unlike me. I don't have a job, right?

18
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:30,200
Then go find something else to do

19
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:33,240
instead of interfering and causing trouble.

20
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:40,960
Fine. Then I'll do things my way.

21
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:50,320
I really didn't want to do this publicly.

22
00:02:50,320 --> 00:02:52,606
But since this woman won't stop,

23
00:02:52,606 --> 00:02:54,544
I have to speak up.

24
00:02:54,544 --> 00:02:57,360
Maybe someone who knows her
can warn her to stay away

25
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,680
from another woman's husband.

26
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:02,800
[I'm here for the tea.]
[Spill it! / Lunch break. Perfect timing!]

27
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:05,600
[Who is she?]
[Waiting for the search terms.]

28
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:10,520
[Reveal who she is!]
[Who is she?]

29
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,160
She's a high-society woman

30
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:16,560
who runs a major real estate firm.

31
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,480
She's also my husband's boss.

32
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,800
[Reveal who she is!]
[Who is she?]

33
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:33,000
[Secret ingredient: a home-wrecker.]
[Feel sorry for the channel owner.]

34
00:03:52,166 --> 00:03:53,493
What's up?

35
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:59,200
Yo is going live to expose you.

36
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:10,000
I never thought trusting him and forgiving him

37
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
would hurt this much.

38
00:04:13,239 --> 00:04:16,080
Do whatever it takes to stop her.

39
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:18,160
How am I supposed to stop her?

40
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:20,920
I don't care. Just do what I say.

41
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,600
[So juicy!]
[Here we go!]

42
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:36,000
[Before judging others, look at yourself.]
[Your company went bust too.]

43
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,870
[You're drowning in debt.]
[No wonder your husband's sick of you.]

44
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:42,560
Show your face if you've got the guts.

45
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,200
Why hide behind a fake account?

46
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,551
[Oops!]

47
00:04:45,551 --> 00:04:49,040
[Debts still have to be paid.]
[If you were good, he wouldn't cheat.]

48
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:53,040
[Check your husband before blaming her.]
[It takes two to cheat.]

49
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:57,200
[Why attack the other woman?]
[Better control your husband.]

50
00:04:57,200 --> 00:05:03,120
[So sick of stupid wives like her.]
[If you're so tough, just leave him.]

51
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,400
I thought I'd keep quiet about this.

52
00:05:07,400 --> 00:05:10,160
But I've decided.

53
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:11,360
I'm suing her.

54
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:19,600
This is my husband. Zoom in.

55
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:22,400
If you see him with another woman,

56
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,960
send me the details privately.

57
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,600
I'm counting on you.

58
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:37,833
- Who's that?
- My boss.

59
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:50,050
[Pete]

60
00:05:57,199 --> 00:06:00,280
What is it, Pete? Why call me again?

61
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:02,640
Stay away from married men, Whan.

62
00:06:02,640 --> 00:06:04,900
You're the one who needs to
stay out of my life.

63
00:06:14,973 --> 00:06:17,853
- Nat!
- Are you crazy? Why are you doing this?

64
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,900
I'm trying to save our marriage.

65
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:22,640
But you two just won't stop.

66
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,000
So I had to do this.

67
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:27,600
Besides,

68
00:06:29,520 --> 00:06:31,240
you wanted me to work, right?

69
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:35,000
Well, here I am, working.

70
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,530
Look at all these views.

71
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:41,580
I'm really disappointed in you.

72
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:48,760
You think I'm proud of you?

73
00:07:04,010 --> 00:07:05,880
I've been minding my own business, Nat.

74
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:07,839
I've never gone after her.

75
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:10,320
She's the one who keeps coming after me.

76
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:12,560
Now she's humiliating me online.

77
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,200
Yo never mentioned your name.

78
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:16,640
Online sleuths are good at this.

79
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:19,506
They're probably digging into me now.

80
00:07:19,506 --> 00:07:22,560
I'm not enjoying this at all.

81
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,026
You need to deal with your wife,

82
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,000
or

83
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,653
I'll take all your projects back.

84
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,977
Why do you keep threatening me with work?

85
00:07:32,578 --> 00:07:34,653
Because work means money.

86
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,876
If you think all I care about is money,

87
00:07:38,876 --> 00:07:41,000
why don't I just let Yo sue you?

88
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:45,000
If you think you can beat me, try it.

89
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:54,169
Whan!

90
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:03,846
I think I can help you.

91
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:08,113
- How?
- Actually,

92
00:08:08,790 --> 00:08:11,840
Pam forced me to take her side.

93
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:16,000
She made me use a fake account
to attack Yo during her live stream.

94
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,560
Really?

95
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:29,840
- What's up?
- Yo is going live to expose you.

96
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,546
Do whatever it takes to stop her.

97
00:08:32,546 --> 00:08:34,840
How am I supposed to stop her?

98
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:37,720
I don't care. Just do what I say.

99
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:42,560
If anything happens, you have proof.

100
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:47,720
I'll always be on your side.

101
00:09:14,959 --> 00:09:16,423
Yes, Pete?

102
00:09:23,163 --> 00:09:25,015
Whan is my ex.

103
00:09:25,015 --> 00:09:26,720
I didn't want you to find out later.

104
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,890
Tell me what you know.

105
00:09:39,226 --> 00:09:40,800
Yes, sir.

106
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:42,388
I'll be there right away.

107
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,640
I'm sorry, Yo.

108
00:09:44,640 --> 00:09:46,336
Something urgent came up. I have to go.

109
00:09:46,336 --> 00:09:47,393
Okay.

110
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:02,840
I just broke up with my boyfriend.
The one I told you about.

111
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:06,110
Can I stay here for a while?

112
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:12,920
Maybe you should spend your time
keeping an eye on your assistant.

113
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,920
Yo!

114
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:29,080
Don't rush to get dressed, Nat.

115
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,080
I've already seen everything.

116
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:33,280
Impressive moves.

117
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:37,280
Way better than when you're with me.

118
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:41,960
Yo, please listen to me.

119
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:44,761
I didn't know what I was doing.
I don't know how this happened.

120
00:12:44,761 --> 00:12:46,800
I took my meds and fell asleep.

121
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,000
And woke up screwing my employee?

122
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,800
And you...

123
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:03,080
I guess I was too nice to you.

124
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:06,320
So you repay me by screwing my husband
in my own house?

125
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:20,080
Ow! Stop hitting me! Please, don't hit me!

126
00:13:27,120 --> 00:13:28,333
Whan, what's wrong?

127
00:13:28,333 --> 00:13:33,000
My lord! Please don't whip me!

128
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,800
I give in! I give in, my lord!

129
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:38,280
You're faking this to get out of it?

130
00:13:52,079 --> 00:13:57,102
See, Yo? I told you
there's something strange in this house.

131
00:13:57,102 --> 00:13:59,803
It was the ghosts. They possessed both of us.

132
00:14:02,599 --> 00:14:04,760
Possessed?

133
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:08,880
If ghosts were real,
they'd go after people who do evil,

134
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:11,160
not possess you two
so you could screw each other.

135
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:14,280
Yo! Yo, wait!

136
00:14:19,306 --> 00:14:21,011
Yo, please listen to me.

137
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:25,320
Yo, wait! Just wait!

138
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:26,680
Yo,

139
00:14:28,203 --> 00:14:31,200
please listen to me.
I swear I'm telling the truth.

140
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:36,040
I swear, I had no idea
what I was doing just now.

141
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:37,800
Before that...

142
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:42,259
I saw a woman in old-fashioned clothes
walking toward me.

143
00:14:42,259 --> 00:14:45,960
After that, I don't remember anything.

144
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:48,920
You've seen her too, haven't you?

145
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,997
Yo,

146
00:14:55,840 --> 00:15:00,600
I know how much Pam has hurt you.

147
00:15:00,600 --> 00:15:05,721
How could I ever hurt you like that too?

148
00:15:05,721 --> 00:15:06,760
Fake!

149
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,713
You've been planning this all along.

150
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:16,520
Fighting with your boyfriend,
getting beaten by your boyfriend,

151
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:20,880
moving in, then screwing my husband.

152
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,819
And now you're shamelessly blaming ghosts.

153
00:15:28,519 --> 00:15:30,043
I'm suing you.

154
00:15:31,600 --> 00:15:33,760
Once you get the court summons,

155
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:36,440
let's see if those ghosts still dare
possess you two to screw again.

156
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:38,440
Yo! Yo!

157
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,680
Get out of this house.

158
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:52,006
No. I'm not leaving.

159
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:57,200
If I leave, Yo will know we're lying.

160
00:15:58,902 --> 00:16:00,428
I'm staying.

161
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:04,640
And I'll make Yo believe
that we were both possessed.

162
00:16:06,560 --> 00:16:09,520
You have to convince her too.

163
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,800
Where are you going?

164
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:22,760
Nat!

165
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:27,840
You expect me to stay and
be a throuple with you two?

166
00:16:29,413 --> 00:16:31,204
I'm done.

167
00:16:31,204 --> 00:16:33,417
Do whatever you want.

168
00:16:33,417 --> 00:16:36,880
Yo, I'm really not lying.

169
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:38,800
- I was possessed--
- Enough.

170
00:16:41,026 --> 00:16:42,872
You have no shame.

171
00:16:42,872 --> 00:16:45,000
Now you're even blaming ghosts.

172
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,993
I'm not blaming them.

173
00:16:46,993 --> 00:16:49,080
We really were possessed.

174
00:16:52,319 --> 00:16:55,720
Yo, you've seen ghosts here yourself.

175
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,903
And what happened in the storage room?

176
00:17:04,039 --> 00:17:05,740
How do you explain that?

177
00:17:08,551 --> 00:17:09,751
Fine.

178
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:17,160
If you're really here,
you heard them, didn't you?

179
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,200
Come on. Possess these two. Let me see it.

180
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:33,546
I'm here.

181
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:38,320
- Whan!
- I'm not Whan.

182
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:42,760
How dare you summon me?

183
00:17:45,790 --> 00:17:48,093
This is my place.

184
00:17:48,093 --> 00:17:49,786
And this man is my husband.

185
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:52,600
Get the hell out!

186
00:17:52,600 --> 00:17:54,480
Go ahead.

187
00:17:57,213 --> 00:17:59,611
Hey! Whan, stop!

188
00:17:59,611 --> 00:18:01,520
I'm not Whan!

189
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:03,120
Please, don't do this!

190
00:18:03,846 --> 00:18:07,766
Whoever dares defy me will pay dearly.

191
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,200
Whan!

192
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,806
Yo, stop! Let go!

193
00:18:41,280 --> 00:18:42,360
Yo.

194
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:47,560
Whan!

195
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:50,680
Whan!

196
00:18:53,520 --> 00:18:54,920
What happened to me?

197
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:04,560
You saw what just happened, didn't you?

198
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,455
I was just angry.

199
00:19:11,455 --> 00:19:12,720
I wasn't possessed.

200
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,913
You know that's not true, Yo.

201
00:19:15,913 --> 00:19:19,069
You said Whan and I were lying,
that ghosts weren't real.

202
00:19:19,069 --> 00:19:21,080
But the way you choked Whan,

203
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,745
the look in your eyes...

204
00:19:22,745 --> 00:19:24,406
That wasn't you.

205
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:38,880
Yo, wait.

206
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,402
Where are you going?

207
00:19:40,402 --> 00:19:41,720
Just calm down.

208
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:42,800
How can I calm down?

209
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:44,640
Yo, just talk to me.

210
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,939
- No, Nat.
- Hey.

211
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,957
Why are you here again?

212
00:19:49,957 --> 00:19:51,840
I told you not to come here.

213
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:53,859
To warn you.

214
00:19:53,859 --> 00:19:56,000
Warn us about what?

215
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:58,320
I saw ghosts following you.

216
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,760
I've been seeing them for a long time.

217
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:08,720
They're here because
every one of them died here.

218
00:20:10,193 --> 00:20:11,998
They've been waiting for you.

219
00:20:11,998 --> 00:20:14,840
I didn't tell you the whole story.

220
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:16,440
Before they died,

221
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:19,440
those bastards were consumed by lust.

222
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:21,920
They had affairs and caught a disease.

223
00:20:21,920 --> 00:20:24,840
The villagers cursed and despised them.

224
00:20:24,840 --> 00:20:26,560
So they dragged their bodies here

225
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,680
and left them for vultures and crows.

226
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,160
What the hell are you talking about?

227
00:20:30,160 --> 00:20:32,200
My ancestors weren't like that.

228
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,200
I'm not talking about your ancestors.

229
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:36,640
Then who are you talking about?

230
00:20:36,640 --> 00:20:38,335
Those ghosts.

231
00:20:38,335 --> 00:20:39,843
After they died,

232
00:20:39,843 --> 00:20:42,200
the villagers found their bones

233
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:44,760
and performed rites for their souls.

234
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:46,840
But those ghosts refused to move on

235
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:48,920
because they were still consumed by lust.

236
00:20:48,920 --> 00:20:50,480
You lying bitch!

237
00:20:52,600 --> 00:20:54,810
Enough. Get out of here.

238
00:20:54,810 --> 00:20:56,424
You're talking nonsense.

239
00:20:56,424 --> 00:20:58,600
Nonsense?

240
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:00,440
Just watch out or they'll possess you.

241
00:21:03,840 --> 00:21:06,000
You're spreading lies about us.

242
00:21:15,280 --> 00:21:17,800
Yo, where are you going?

243
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,400
Stop following me, Nat.

244
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:33,760
What the hell were you doing?
Why didn't you warn me first?

245
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:37,040
And how did you make those things fall?

246
00:21:37,040 --> 00:21:38,480
I didn't.

247
00:21:38,480 --> 00:21:39,840
Then how did they fall?

248
00:21:39,840 --> 00:21:41,836
I don't know.

249
00:21:41,836 --> 00:21:45,281
I had to do something
to make Yo believe I was possessed.

250
00:21:46,605 --> 00:21:50,480
But when Yo started choking me,

251
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:52,040
I don't think that was really her.

252
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,640
Yo, let go! Hey!

253
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:03,160
I don't believe in ghosts.

254
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,866
And I'm not afraid of them either.

255
00:22:24,600 --> 00:22:27,520
[301 Detective Office]

256
00:22:28,679 --> 00:22:30,160
Hello, Yo.

257
00:22:30,160 --> 00:22:32,800
I know now what you were trying to tell me.

258
00:22:35,820 --> 00:22:37,840
Whan is having an affair with my husband.

259
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:40,520
How long have you known?

260
00:22:42,880 --> 00:22:44,800
Since before Whan and I broke up.

261
00:22:48,600 --> 00:22:50,920
I saw a photo of your husband on Whan's phone.

262
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:55,720
I'm sorry I didn't tell you sooner.

263
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,120
Why are you apologizing?

264
00:22:58,080 --> 00:22:59,800
None of this has anything to do with you.

265
00:23:02,840 --> 00:23:04,160
Thanks for looking out for me.

266
00:23:23,360 --> 00:23:25,600
I didn't know what I was doing.

267
00:23:30,050 --> 00:23:31,560
But the way you choked Whan,

268
00:23:31,560 --> 00:23:33,080
the look in your eyes...

269
00:23:33,080 --> 00:23:35,000
That wasn't you.

270
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:36,880
I saw ghosts following you.

271
00:23:38,880 --> 00:23:40,466
Jump.

272
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,780
Nat! Wake up! Nat!

273
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:07,720
Why'd the power go out now?

274
00:24:09,760 --> 00:24:12,360
I've got money to pay the bill!

275
00:24:12,360 --> 00:24:14,960
I'll pay five months in advance.

276
00:24:17,389 --> 00:24:18,500
Save myself the trouble.

277
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,166
What the hell is going on?

278
00:25:10,360 --> 00:25:13,581
I've drunk several bottles
and still have plenty left.

279
00:25:13,581 --> 00:25:15,710
I love this job.

280
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:19,950
Lying is what I do best.

281
00:25:20,800 --> 00:25:24,560
Tell them exactly what I told you. Got it?

282
00:25:24,560 --> 00:25:26,938
I saw ghosts following you.

283
00:25:26,938 --> 00:25:28,520
I've seen them for a long time.

284
00:25:28,520 --> 00:25:30,880
They all died here.

285
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:33,360
They've been waiting for you.

286
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:37,360
Just don't forget my hush money.

287
00:25:37,360 --> 00:25:39,600
I love getting paid to talk nonsense.

288
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:43,160
And you did.

289
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:46,400
Of course I did. I got paid for it.

290
00:25:50,224 --> 00:25:51,225
Who's there?

291
00:25:54,865 --> 00:25:55,865
Who?

292
00:26:28,893 --> 00:26:30,026
Who's there?

293
00:27:05,120 --> 00:27:06,800
A ghost!

294
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:10,423
You, bitch! The ghost you lied about,
you bastard.

295
00:27:15,240 --> 00:27:18,453
I'm scared! I'm scared!

296
00:27:18,453 --> 00:27:21,120
Please don't hurt me!

297
00:27:21,120 --> 00:27:24,520
Why weren't you scared
when you were spreading lies about us?

298
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:30,240
Do you know how much we suffered when we died?

299
00:27:30,865 --> 00:27:35,560
I was wrong! I'm sorry! Please forgive me!

300
00:27:35,560 --> 00:27:37,920
Fine. I'll forgive you.

301
00:27:37,920 --> 00:27:40,600
Go confess right now that you lied.

302
00:27:40,600 --> 00:27:41,880
Go! Now!

303
00:27:41,880 --> 00:27:44,666
I'm going right now!

304
00:28:16,640 --> 00:28:18,200
Auntie Nong!

305
00:28:22,200 --> 00:28:23,800
Auntie Nong, are you home?

306
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:05,500
[Nat]

307
00:29:14,480 --> 00:29:16,600
I'm afraid Yo might file for divorce.

308
00:29:16,600 --> 00:29:19,160
Do you have anything we can use
to blackmail her?

309
00:29:21,520 --> 00:29:24,360
I can't think of anything right now.

310
00:29:24,360 --> 00:29:26,851
But I'll see what I can find. I'll do my best.

311
00:29:26,851 --> 00:29:28,055
The sooner, the better.

312
00:29:29,360 --> 00:29:33,000
For now, we need to be nice to Yo

313
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:34,880
so she doesn't get any angrier.

314
00:29:35,710 --> 00:29:36,711
Okay.

315
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,973
Miss!

316
00:29:56,800 --> 00:29:58,481
Are you all right?

317
00:29:58,481 --> 00:30:00,340
You've been parked here since last night.

318
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:05,280
I came to make an offering, but I fell asleep.

319
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:14,680
So much has happened to me.

320
00:30:16,320 --> 00:30:18,120
You know something, don't you?

321
00:30:21,840 --> 00:30:24,960
You warned me not to go back
to my great-grandfather's house.

322
00:30:24,960 --> 00:30:26,631
Did you need something?

323
00:30:26,631 --> 00:30:29,680
Leave now and never come back.

324
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:33,447
They're still here. They never left.

325
00:30:33,447 --> 00:30:36,520
My warning was for your husband.

326
00:30:38,520 --> 00:30:40,240
Why? What's wrong with him?

327
00:30:40,981 --> 00:30:42,480
I don't know.

328
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:46,321
I only know that what you saw
wasn't trying to hurt you.

329
00:30:50,171 --> 00:30:52,372
What I saw really was a ghost, wasn't it?

330
00:30:53,200 --> 00:30:56,360
You're the one who can answer that best.

331
00:30:56,360 --> 00:31:00,020
If you're asking if ghosts are real,

332
00:31:00,020 --> 00:31:02,680
after decades as an undertaker,

333
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:04,538
I can tell you they are.

334
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:08,000
The question is whether you can
communicate with them.

335
00:31:24,159 --> 00:31:27,960
I thought you and your wife
were going to team up and sue me.

336
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:31,435
I know there's no way
I'd ever beat you in court.

337
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:40,840
Actually, I only let my employees stay here.

338
00:31:41,840 --> 00:31:44,623
But I work for you too.

339
00:31:44,623 --> 00:31:46,360
You said it yourself.

340
00:31:46,360 --> 00:31:47,840
You work for me.

341
00:31:53,520 --> 00:31:54,960
Of course.

342
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,200
In everything?

343
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:58,838
Yes.

344
00:31:59,505 --> 00:32:01,000
Everything.

345
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:32,560
If you really exist,

346
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:37,480
please tell me what the truth is.

347
00:33:25,560 --> 00:33:30,553
Please, give me a sign that you're really here.

348
00:33:46,560 --> 00:33:47,800
Yo!

349
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:52,120
I saw your car out front.

350
00:33:52,120 --> 00:33:54,185
I'm glad you came back.

351
00:33:56,766 --> 00:33:59,386
I only came back to find out

352
00:33:59,386 --> 00:34:02,431
if you were really possessed
like you and Whan claimed.

353
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:05,080
Whatever you want, Yo.

354
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:08,433
I'm just glad you're back.

355
00:34:10,876 --> 00:34:14,166
I'll never let a ghost possess me again.

356
00:34:15,720 --> 00:34:18,160
You never believed in ghosts.

357
00:34:18,800 --> 00:34:20,640
Now you're talking like they're real.

358
00:34:22,686 --> 00:34:24,237
How do you expect me to believe you?

359
00:34:25,038 --> 00:34:27,039
Then why do you believe Auntie Nong?

360
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:30,480
I hired her for my content before.

361
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:33,040
So I figured if I could hire her,

362
00:34:33,880 --> 00:34:35,520
then you could too.

363
00:34:53,440 --> 00:34:56,520
Yo, wait! Where are you going?

364
00:34:58,353 --> 00:35:00,880
I smell something outside.
I'm going to check it out.

365
00:35:00,880 --> 00:35:02,640
Whatever it is, just leave it.

366
00:35:02,640 --> 00:35:05,021
It's late. It's dangerous.

367
00:35:11,440 --> 00:35:14,265
Okay, I won't touch you.

368
00:35:15,240 --> 00:35:17,360
But please, don't go outside.

369
00:35:18,517 --> 00:35:21,836
A good ghost wouldn't lure someone
outside at night, Yo.

370
00:36:49,232 --> 00:36:50,638
Auntie Nong!

371
00:36:52,200 --> 00:36:53,720
Auntie Nong!

372
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:26,880
Do you think Auntie Nong led me here
to find her body?

373
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:28,120
I don't know.

374
00:37:30,200 --> 00:37:32,400
But scientifically,

375
00:37:32,400 --> 00:37:35,720
a body starts giving off a strong odor
about three days after death.

376
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:37,840
That's probably what you smelled.

377
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:43,192
Could the smell really travel all the way
to my house?

378
00:37:45,980 --> 00:37:49,084
Auntie Nong wasn't murdered, was she?

379
00:37:50,400 --> 00:37:53,643
You think your husband might've killed her
to keep her quiet?

380
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:57,063
Maybe I'm overthinking it.

381
00:37:58,720 --> 00:38:01,247
But right now, I feel like
I don't know him at all.

382
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:05,306
He keeps doing things I'd never expect.

383
00:38:07,040 --> 00:38:09,924
Based on the preliminary examination,
it wasn't murder.

384
00:38:10,763 --> 00:38:12,458
Auntie Nong died of heart failure.

385
00:38:12,458 --> 00:38:14,433
Simply put, she had a heart attack.

386
00:38:15,320 --> 00:38:18,200
But if you still have doubts,

387
00:38:18,200 --> 00:38:21,274
I'll look into your husband and the house.

388
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:25,720
From what you've told me,
strange things started after you moved in.

389
00:38:27,647 --> 00:38:29,021
I've worked a lot of cases

390
00:38:29,021 --> 00:38:31,047
and seen plenty I couldn't explain.

391
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:34,084
If that house is hiding a secret,

392
00:38:34,084 --> 00:38:36,000
I should be able to find something.

393
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:54,120
Let me ask the spirits' permission first.

394
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:38,520
Do you sense anything?

395
00:39:39,971 --> 00:39:41,826
Ghosts aren't that easy to encounter.

396
00:39:43,547 --> 00:39:47,200
Traditionally, people tend to see ghosts

397
00:39:47,200 --> 00:39:50,918
when they're weak, sick, or vulnerable.

398
00:39:53,320 --> 00:39:56,395
Like now, around sunset,

399
00:39:57,160 --> 00:39:59,000
what we call the twilight hour.

400
00:39:59,826 --> 00:40:03,204
It's a transition when our eyes
are adjusting to the fading light,

401
00:40:03,204 --> 00:40:07,000
so things can look distorted

402
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:08,760
and make us think we're seeing things.

403
00:40:13,280 --> 00:40:19,203
Sometimes, low-frequency sounds
can be so faint we barely hear them.

404
00:40:20,280 --> 00:40:22,120
They can make your hair stand on end.

405
00:40:22,800 --> 00:40:27,300
That may be when some kind of energy
can come through.

406
00:40:30,920 --> 00:40:36,087
I feel the same way I did
when I found Auntie Nong's body.

407
00:40:48,093 --> 00:40:50,394
I think we should make merit for them.

408
00:41:16,600 --> 00:41:19,440
I asked the spirits at your house
to help open the way.

409
00:41:20,453 --> 00:41:22,917
I also dedicated merit to Auntie Nong.

410
00:41:30,160 --> 00:41:31,840
Uncle Chan!

411
00:41:32,715 --> 00:41:35,691
Can I ask you something?

412
00:41:37,033 --> 00:41:42,033
Why don't ghosts appear
when we want to see them?

413
00:41:42,720 --> 00:41:46,400
But when we don't, why do they come
and haunt us?

414
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:47,773
They're not haunting us.

415
00:41:48,661 --> 00:41:52,456
Our energies just happen to align.

416
00:41:54,400 --> 00:41:56,885
Have you heard of a focused mind?

417
00:41:57,619 --> 00:41:59,274
Yes.

418
00:42:00,200 --> 00:42:05,380
A focused mind becomes still,
like water when the sediment settles.

419
00:42:07,480 --> 00:42:10,214
When the mind is clear,

420
00:42:10,214 --> 00:42:12,720
we can see things more clearly.

421
00:42:12,720 --> 00:42:15,000
And if we share a karmic connection,

422
00:42:15,000 --> 00:42:16,929
we may be able to see the spirit world.

423
00:42:18,840 --> 00:42:21,520
But I want to warn you, for your own good.

424
00:42:21,520 --> 00:42:24,461
Don't get involved in things
that aren't your concern.

425
00:42:24,461 --> 00:42:27,213
And if you don't want to create more karma,

426
00:42:28,148 --> 00:42:30,251
if you can put something behind you,

427
00:42:30,251 --> 00:42:31,988
let it go.

428
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:41,120
I think Uncle Chan is right.

429
00:42:42,080 --> 00:42:43,876
That's why I let Whan go.

430
00:42:44,480 --> 00:42:45,820
But I understand.

431
00:42:45,820 --> 00:42:47,804
You've been through more than I have.

432
00:42:47,804 --> 00:42:49,820
It's hard to let go.

433
00:42:51,559 --> 00:42:53,951
I don't want to get back with Nat.

434
00:42:55,720 --> 00:42:58,320
I just want to find out

435
00:42:58,320 --> 00:43:01,120
what's really happening to me.

436
00:43:01,120 --> 00:43:02,696
I can sense those spirits.

437
00:43:02,696 --> 00:43:06,160
I think they're trying to tell me something.

438
00:43:06,160 --> 00:43:08,240
We just can't communicate.

439
00:43:44,090 --> 00:43:46,320
When the mind is clear,

440
00:43:46,320 --> 00:43:48,480
we can see things more clearly.

441
00:43:48,480 --> 00:43:50,200
And if we share a karmic connection,

442
00:43:50,200 --> 00:43:52,240
we may be able to see the spirit world.

443
00:44:04,160 --> 00:44:06,514
Why waste your time?

444
00:44:06,514 --> 00:44:08,855
You know she won't answer.

445
00:44:09,640 --> 00:44:11,920
I don't want her getting any angrier.

446
00:44:11,920 --> 00:44:15,800
If it's that complicated,
just ask her straight out.

447
00:44:15,800 --> 00:44:18,471
Ask her what she wants and how much.

448
00:44:18,471 --> 00:44:20,200
I'll pay her and get this over with.

449
00:44:20,200 --> 00:44:22,760
You know Yo isn't after money.

450
00:44:32,080 --> 00:44:33,840
But she needs money right now.

451
00:44:35,760 --> 00:44:38,033
I'm willing to pay for your freedom.

452
00:44:38,920 --> 00:44:41,230
Then we can avoid a messy divorce battle.

453
00:44:44,284 --> 00:44:46,429
Because no matter what,

454
00:44:46,429 --> 00:44:48,332
the two of us aren't breaking up.

455
00:45:00,984 --> 00:45:02,649
That's right.

456
00:45:02,649 --> 00:45:05,210
I'm not breaking up with Nat either.

457
00:45:07,040 --> 00:45:08,722
If the three of us are okay with this,

458
00:45:09,800 --> 00:45:13,760
your wife is the one who has to go.

459
00:45:46,160 --> 00:45:48,880
Go. Go and see.

460
00:45:49,520 --> 00:45:51,520
See it with your own eyes.

461
00:46:05,909 --> 00:46:07,560
What is this?

462
00:46:29,200 --> 00:46:31,640
There's nothing suspicious
about that house, Pete.

463
00:46:31,640 --> 00:46:34,440
Something in there is waiting.
Maybe it's trying to tell us something.

464
00:46:34,440 --> 00:46:38,040
You three hurt someone in a past life,
and they still hold a grudge.

465
00:46:38,040 --> 00:46:39,529
It felt so real,

466
00:46:39,529 --> 00:46:41,520
like I'd been pulled into their past.

467
00:46:41,520 --> 00:46:44,880
You have to help us. You have to help us.

468
00:46:44,880 --> 00:46:47,266
And the one holding the grudge,
who do you think it is?

469
00:46:48,880 --> 00:46:51,577
What you do to others will come back to you.

470
00:46:51,577 --> 00:46:55,720
The day you see a crow
is the day karma begins to work.

471
00:46:55,720 --> 00:46:57,440
You must die!

472
00:46:57,440 --> 00:46:59,120
Nat, watch out!
